fixture pogo_off_the_dummy
doc BUILD.md s5 Pogo, "on hitting an enemy ... bounces the player"; s6 Flame, "each pogo 8". Ash drops onto the dummy with the down-strike.
room test/dummy_pogo
spawn 300 460
frames 20
input
  0 D attack
end
expect
  mark bounce 0..12 event.pogo=1
  at bounce event.hit=1 enemy.hp=190 flame=8 vy<0
  never bounce+1..19 event.hit=1
end
